      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to be so much... i had a career, a life, people who actually needed me for things. now i'm just sitting here and i feel like i'm just a drain on everyone. like my family has to keep pretending i'm okay and it's just exhausting for them. i feel like i'm just a heavy weight they're all forced to carry around. what's the point of keeping up this act when there's nothing underneath anymore? it feels like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something that actually matters.",
